                                "sense_id": "1373c223-b9c6-3433-9b3a-aceb17106d8b",
                                "text": "Almost all of these names are adjectival in form, derived from some other personal or place-name, usually by the addition of the suffix -ius, -aeus, -eius, or -eus; […]"
                            }
                        ]
